her, and while the gathering quests are perilous, we've passed some policies to confiscate the funds of dead adventurers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988340/extras/42a6abc209ecb3d7b9f3e28219ff70a7.poster.avif?t=1746072007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988340/extras/42a6abc209ecb3d7b9f3e28219ff70a7.webm?t=1746072007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base - Construction &amp; Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can build large, exclusive rooms on the surface to research technology, develop goods, produce equipment and machines, as well as grow various types of crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988340/extras/fd11a8cd72f70b552155cc95a729f78d.poster.avif?t=1746072007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988340/extras/fd11a8cd72f70b552155cc95a729f78d.webm?t=1746072007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy various equipment, robotic arms, and conveyor belts to automate production. Players can also build highly efficient facilities underground to produce various types of basic and processed resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988340/extras/916e419b1482919a3eba4f010910891a.poster.avif?t=1746072007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.